@startuml sd-03-add-evidence
' SD-03 - addEvidence (CO3)
' Linked to: UC01 steps 3, 4 and extension 4a, SSD-01 loop, CO3, BR01, SC02
title SD-03 – addEvidence(evidenceItem) (CO3)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

participant ":StudentUI" as UI <<UI layer>>
participant ":SubmitPlacement\nRequestHandler" as H <<controller>>
participant "r : Request" as R
participant "req : EvidenceRequirements" as ER

UI -> H : addEvidence(evidenceItem)
activate H

H -> R : addEvidence(evidenceItem)
activate R
note right of R
  CO3 postcondition:
  evidenceItem added to r.evidence.
  r.status is not changed (stays IN_PROGRESS).
end note
R --> H
deactivate R

H -> R : missingEvidence()
activate R
R -> ER : missingFrom(evidence)
activate ER
ER --> R : missing
deactivate ER
R --> H : missing
deactivate R

H --> UI : missing
deactivate H
note right of UI
  4a: if missing is not empty the student is told
  which items are missing and can add them (SC02).
  If missing is empty the evidence is complete.
end note
@enduml
